&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Apply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:220,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:90}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;If you meet most of the criteria, apply through this listing with your CV.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Mission&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Protect data that matters. Build capability the United Kingdom depends on. Launch into operations, not pitch decks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Bluestaq Ltd is committed to an inclusive workplace. We welcome applications from all backgrounds, including career returners, service leavers, reservists and people underrepresented in defence technology. We recruit on capability and potential in line with the Equality Act 2010. If you need reasonable adjustments at any stage, tell us when you apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16314602,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276,&amp;quot;335572071&amp;quot;:8,&amp;quot;335572072&amp;quot;:8,&amp;quot;335572073&amp;quot;:12874308,&amp;quot;335572075&amp;quot;:8,&amp;quot;335572076&amp;quot;:8,&amp;quot;335572077&amp;quot;:12874308,&amp;quot;335572079&amp;quot;:8,&amp;quot;335572080&amp;quot;:8,&amp;quot;335572081&amp;quot;:12874308,&amp;quot;335572083&amp;quot;:8,&amp;quot;335572084&amp;quot;:8,&amp;quot;335572085&amp;quot;:12874308,&amp;quot;469789798&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789802&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789806&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789810&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are proud to support the Armed Forces Covenant. Service leavers and reservists who know watch-keeping, escalation and operating under pressure will find this role speaks their language.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;When you apply to a job on this site, the personal data contained in your application will be collected by&amp;nbsp;Bluestaq LLC (&quot;Controller&quot;), located at 2 S. Cascade Ave., Ste 200, Colorado Springs, CO 80903, contactable at ----- Controller’s data protection officer is Ashley Higgins, who can be contacted at -----
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your personal data will be processed for the purposes of managing Controller&#39;s recruitment activities, including setting up and conducting interviews and assessments, evaluating results, and other steps in the recruitment and hiring process. This processing is lawful under Article 6(1)(f) of the UK GDPR as necessary for Controller&#39;s legitimate interests in soliciting, evaluating, and selecting applicants for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your personal data will be shared with Greenhouse Software, Inc., a cloud services provider based in the United States engaged by Controller to help manage recruitment on its behalf. Your data will accordingly be transferred to the United States once submitted. Greenhouse is certified under the UK Extension to the EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework, which the UK government has confirmed provides an adequate level of protection for personal data transferred from the UK.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your personal data will be retained for&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;180 days from the date of your application, reflecting the time limit (including possible extensions) for bringing recruitment-related legal claims in the UK, after which it will be deleted or anonymised. If you are hired, your application data will become part of your employee record, retained in accordance with our employee privacy notice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Under the UK GDPR, you have the right to request access to, rectification of, or erasure of your personal data, and to request that processing be restricted. You also have the right to object to processing carried out on the basis of legitimate interests, and the right to data portability. You may lodge a complaint with the UK Information Commissioner&#39;s Office (ICO) at ico.org.uk or 0303 123 1113.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
